	"Description": "Content-only plugin providing the /Traffic/ mount point for MF_UnpackTrafficVehicleInstanceCustomData, a material function City Sample's vehicle paint materials (M_Veh_CarPaint etc.) reference via a hard path. Deliberately NOT the real Epic MassTraffic plugin (no Mass AI traffic simulation, no C++ modules, no ChaosVehiclesPlugin/ZoneGraph/MassAI dependency) -- confirmed via direct binary inspection that MF_UnpackTrafficVehicleInstanceCustomData's own only dependencies are /Script/CoreUObject, /Script/Engine, and /Script/UnrealEd (standard engine classes), and it uses only built-in material expression node types (MaterialExpressionCustom, MaterialExpressionPerInstanceCustomData), not anything defined by MassTraffic's own C++ source. See KNOWN_GAPS_AND_ISSUES.md.",
